### Register User
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "password_confirmation": "password123",
  "age": 30,
  "weight": 70.5,
  "height": 175.3,
  "gender": "male"
}

###

### Login User
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

